            <ArticleTitle>Improving the management of children's pain in A&amp;E.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper describes a project that sought to improve the management of children's pain in an A&amp;E department. Pain management is not always seen as a priority in A&amp;E departments. The problems are highlighted through two case studies, and guidelines to improve practice were developed in collaboration with a specialist multidisciplinary team.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
